' Evidence: Laplace/app/Laplace.Endpoints.OpenAICompat/EndpointMappings.Chess.cs SHA256 d86eead36cf95b90252f6e228a9831f943e4518a6307e46476fad986bf25e674
' Evidence: Laplace/app/Laplace.Chess/Service/ChessEngineConnections.cs SHA256 9378697864c3af3bdac3f4fe8e797be5057c6f499761606cb05f3d3c4751c557
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFCFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title Monorepo chess — lab jobs, streams and retained artifacts
start
if (Catalog or preview?) then (yes)
 :Read installed connection profiles; expose public metadata;
 :Preview selects optional Laplace / Stockfish profile by name and implementation;
 :Validate credential-free WSS endpoint and installed absolute connector/config paths;
 :Reject local Syzygy override for remote Stockfish;
 :Build arguments and probe configured connector presence;
elseif (Start job?) then (yes)
 :Parse job kind/config; reject managed LichessBot job with 409;
 :Validate Cutechess-specific configuration and installed profile selection when applicable;
 :Require browser/API-key requester; call lab.StartJob;
else (existing job)
 :Require same tenant ownership; otherwise 404;
 if (Events?) then (yes)
  :Stream EventReader channel as flushed SSE;
 elseif (Terminal?) then (yes)
  :Stream terminal lines after sequence; disable proxy buffering;
 elseif (Transcript download?) then (yes)
  :Serve retained transcript file if present; otherwise ring snapshot text;
 elseif (Named artifact?) then (yes)
  :Look up name in job artifact dictionary; require existing file; serve by extension;
 elseif (Ingest retained PGN?) then (yes)
  :Require games.pgn; reject Pending/Running job;
  :Call IngestArtifactAsync and return result;
 else (read/stop/list)
  :Return or stop owned job; list filters to workspace;
 endif
endif
stop
footer
Source-reviewed orchestration. Nested semantics remain open; no runtime acceptance
claimed. Complete lab HTTP routes and installed-profile selector reviewed. EventReader and
replaying terminal are different transport sources; broadcast/replay guarantees depend on
service implementation. Artifact paths come from retained job metadata, not arbitrary
requested filesystem paths. Profile selection accepts installed names, not caller-supplied
endpoints or credentials. The probe checks connector file presence, not worker
reachability, authentication or match acceptance. Start validates the selection but passes
original config to StartJob; the downstream match runner remains a separate boundary.
Lichess legacy start/stop return 410 directing to shared selection controls.
end footer

